[42] Another product of Fun World ghost masks we'd like to cover is the #9225 - Ghost Mask with Fancy Shroud assortment which originally included four designs in latex (different than vinyl) and featured polyester hoods with triangular cut ends. The faces were similar black blocked expressions with deeper textures, wrinkles and contours. We believe they were released in 1996. They originally came with Fantastic Faces 'party orb' style header cards and then Fearsome Faces 'bat & moon' style header cards in the late 90s, though the masks did not change much in quality. New designs were added in later years, like a classic reaper skull and a demonic skull.

